page Invoices

type Invoice {id, client, amount:number, paid:bool, due:date}
data invoices:Invoice[] GET /api/invoices
  settle PATCH /api/invoices/{id} {paid} optimistic

state view=all|open|paid

on {view} >invoices.list

head Invoices — {invoices.open.count} awaiting payment

row between
  metric {invoices.amount.sum}
  btn Refresh quiet >invoices.list

tabs view

table invoices where={view} sort=due cols="Client, Amount, Due, Paid"
  text {client}
  text {amount}
  text {due}
  check {paid} aria="Mark {client} paid" >invoices.settle
  empty No invoices match this view.

p The state field here is `paid`, not `done`. `{invoices.open.count}` filters on it because the
p compiler reads the flag from the row type rather than from a name it hoped for.
